      "description": "College of Environmental Science and Forestry\nJob Posting: Facility Operations Assistant 1, SG-6 (Custodial Services) Continuous Posting College of Environmental Science and Forestry \n\tJob Posting: Facility Operations Assistant 1, SG-6 (Custodial Services) Continuous Posting Title Home Human Resources Returning Applicant Login Previous Next Careers > Search Jobs > Search Results > Job Details Facility Operations Assistant 1, SG-6 (Custodial Services) Continuous Posting Category: Support Staff Subscribe: New Job Alerts RSS Job Feed Department: Facilities & Operations Locations: Syracuse, NY Posted: Oct 16, 2026 Closes: Open Until Filled Type: Full-time Salary Type: Annually Salary Range: $37,862.00 - $37,862.00 Position ID: 205879 Share About College of Environmental Science and Forestry: Founded in 1911, ESF is the nation's oldest and one of the most respected academic institutions dedicated to building a sustainable future and the study of the environment. The College's main campus is in Syracuse, New York and it has regional campuses and field stations throughout Central New York, and in New York's Thousand Islands and Adirondack Mountain regions. ESF consistently earns high academic, research, and sustainability rankings in Forbes, Peterson's Guide, The Princeton Review, The Washington Monthly, US News and World Report, and other national college ratings and guidebooks. Job Description: TITLE/SALARY GRADE:     Facility Operations Assistant 1 - Custodial/SG- 6 LOCATION:                         Facilities - Custodial Services DURATION:                         Permanent SALARY: $ $37,862 non-negotiable (Note: current or reconstructed salary for State employees in accordance with NYS Audit and Control) POSITION DESCRIPTION:  Perform a variety of routine manual tasks, requiring medium to heavy physical effort to clean & maintain campus buildings. Specific cleaning tasks may include but are not limited to sweeping, vacuuming, mopping, dusting, 